    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a feeling though. it's what i actually did. i see the consequences every single day. i'm not just \"distressed\", i'm a person who caused real damage. how can you say i'm not broken when my actions prove that i am? it feels like i'm just carrying around this rot that's gonna keep hurting people no matter what i do.",
